WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,680
It’s over. It’s full of snow outside.

2
00:00:01,880 --> 00:00:02,880
The door is buried in snow

3
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:05,200
Buried How many were buried?

4
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:06,820
It's all your fault

5
00:00:07,020 --> 00:00:08,500
We have to build the igloo here.

6
00:00:08,580 --> 00:00:09,620
This is blocked

7
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:10,660
A place that can be blocked

8
00:00:10,660 --> 00:00:11,900
It is also a place where snow is stored

9
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:13,020
It snowed so heavily last night

10
00:00:13,020 --> 00:00:14,500
They all piled up on our side.

11
00:00:14,660 --> 00:00:16,500
Me, how could I know

12
00:00:16,740 --> 00:00:18,620
I see Mou Chuan also built his house here.

13
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:20,100
I just followed the digging

14
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:22,100
Do you still have the nerve to stand up for Mou Chuan?

15
00:00:22,180 --> 00:00:23,540
The door to the human world is only so small.

16
00:00:23,540 --> 00:00:24,900
What are you talking about?

17
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:26,540
It's all so tall and wide now it's better

18
00:00:26,540 --> 00:00:29,140
How do you open the door when there is snow outside?

19
00:00:29,260 --> 00:00:31,260
What should I do? Why not?

20
00:00:31,260 --> 00:00:32,700
Are you buried alive here like this?

21
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:38,630
I don't want to

22
00:00:38,630 --> 00:00:41,140
If you don’t want to die, you can’t dig the door open.

23
00:00:41,140 --> 00:00:42,060
Just smashed the door panel

24
00:00:42,060 --> 00:00:43,860
Let's dig so many people from here.

25
00:00:43,860 --> 00:00:46,580
I don’t believe I can’t dig it out, dig it out quickly

26
00:00:49,430 --> 00:00:50,350
dig dig
